# Source media that stays on disk but never ships.
#
# Cloudflare Pages refuses a whole deployment if any single file is over
# 25 MiB, so an original that size would block a deploy even though no page
# links to it directly.
#
# QuickTime and TIFF are here as formats rather than filenames: neither is
# something a browser can be relied on to display, so anything in them is a
# working file by definition.
*.mov
*.tif
*.tiff

# Old masters already superseded by an optimized version in use elsewhere —
# swept here so they're easy to delete in bulk later. See the folder itself
# for which project each one belongs to.
_old-masters/

# Unused: the horizontal Laue clip is over the deploy limit and nothing on
# the page loads it (only the vertical clip, via its -web.mp4, is live).
projects/lounge_chair/lounge_vid_hero_horizontal.mp4

# Scratch output from local tooling.
_dims.html
_sheet.html

# Claude Code's per-project settings; nothing a visitor should be served.
.claude/
